#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1
msgid "Distribution customization"
msgstr "发行版定制"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:3
msgid ""
"A [distribution](glossary.md#deployments) is one deployment of "
"HybridInference: its own code, assets and Compose settings, plus the "
"application settings it keeps in the database, such as its name, "
"branding, models and feature switches. This page is for operators setting"
" one up: what each kind of customization costs, the site configuration "
"document, and how to upgrade."
msgstr ""
"[发行版](glossary.md#deployments)是 HybridInference 的一个部署：它自己的代码、静态资源和 "
"Compose "
"设置，加上保存在数据库中的应用设置，例如名称、品牌、模型和功能开关。本页面向搭建发行版的运维人员，说明各种定制方式的代价、站点配置文档，以及如何升级。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:9
msgid ""
"The standard application provides default home, account and terms pages, "
"a dashboard, API-key management, the Playground, request history and the "
"admin console. Choose the smallest interface that covers your needs; the "
"[Quickstart](router-tutorial.md) runs a local example of the standard "
"site."
msgstr ""
"标准应用自带默认的首页、账号页和条款页，以及控制台首页、API key "
"管理、Playground、请求历史和管理控制台。请选择能满足需求的最小接口；[快速上手](router-"
"tutorial.md)会在本地运行一个标准站点的示例。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:14
msgid "What you can customize"
msgstr "可以定制什么"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Where"
msgstr "在哪里改"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Cost"
msgstr "代价"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Site name, public URL, support email, and feature restrictions such as "
"public registration and RAG"
msgstr "站点名称、公开 URL、支持邮箱，以及公开注册、RAG 等功能限制"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`SITE_CONFIGURATION` in Admin"
msgstr "Admin 中的 `SITE_CONFIGURATION`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Applies on settings refresh"
msgstr "设置刷新时应用"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Logo, favicon, links, API example, team and sponsors, data-policy notice"
msgstr "Logo、favicon、链接、API 示例、团队与赞助方、数据政策说明"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"`SITE_BRANDING` in Admin; optional images mounted through "
"`SITE_ASSETS_DIR`"
msgstr "Admin 中的 `SITE_BRANDING`；可选的图片通过 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` 挂载"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Models, endpoints, aliases, weights and router settings"
msgstr "模型、端点、别名、权重和 router 设置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Admin Routing, `MODEL_CATALOG` and `ROUTING_POLICY` (see "
"[Configuration](configuration.md))"
msgstr "Admin Routing、`MODEL_CATALOG` 和 `ROUTING_POLICY`（见[配置](configuration.md)）"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Catalog and policy changes need a backend restart; route edits apply "
"online"
msgstr "目录和策略的修改需要重启后端；路由编辑在线生效"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Cloud Agent link and `/agents` proxy"
msgstr "Cloud Agent 链接和 `/agents` 代理"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Frontend environment: `AGENT_PUBLIC_URL`, `AGENT_WEB_INTERNAL_URL`, "
"`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_INTERNAL_URL`"
msgstr "前端环境变量：`AGENT_PUBLIC_URL`、`AGENT_WEB_INTERNAL_URL`、`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_INTERNAL_URL`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Recreate the frontend container"
msgstr "重建前端容器"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Link to another deployment's OpenInfra page"
msgstr "链接到另一个部署的 OpenInfra 页面"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Frontend environment: `OPENINFRA_PUBLIC_URL`"
msgstr "前端环境变量：`OPENINFRA_PUBLIC_URL`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"The home page, the frame and wording of the account pages, the legal text"
" and sign-up confirmations, public page titles and language"
msgstr "首页、账号页的外框和措辞、法律文本和注册确认项、公开页面的标题和语言"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "A [Site UI module](site-ui-modules.md)"
msgstr "[Site UI 模块](site-ui-modules.md)"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Build a frontend image with the module"
msgstr "构建包含模块的前端镜像"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Adapters, Cloud Agent access rules and quota reporting"
msgstr "adapter、Cloud Agent 访问规则和额度上报"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "[Backend extensions](backend-extensions.md) listed in `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS`"
msgstr "列在 `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` 中的[后端扩展](backend-extensions.md)"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Restart the backend; rebuild if the code is packaged in the image"
msgstr "重启后端；如果代码打包在镜像中，则需重新构建"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Extra routes, a different console layout, a new authentication flow"
msgstr "新增路由、不同的控制台布局、新的认证流程"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Application source, in upstream or a fork you maintain"
msgstr "应用源码，在上游或你维护的 fork 中修改"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Rebuild the affected images; outside Site UI API v1"
msgstr "重新构建受影响的镜像；不在 Site UI API v1 的范围内"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:27
msgid ""
"Configuration cannot change the console's theme, sidebar or layout, and a"
" navigation link does not create the page it points to."
msgstr "配置无法改变控制台的主题、侧边栏或布局；添加导航链接也不会创建它指向的页面。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:30
msgid ""
"A Site UI module ships inside the console image. Its components, "
"stylesheet and wording travel with the image, never through `/site-"
"config`, so the pinned pair of source commits decides what a running "
"image shows. Its dependencies come from the application's lockfile; a "
"module's own `node_modules` is not used."
msgstr ""
"Site UI 模块随控制台镜像一起发布。它的组件、样式表和文案都在镜像里，从不经由 `/site-config` "
"下发，因此运行中的镜像显示什么，由钉住的那一对源码提交决定。它的依赖来自应用的 lockfile；模块自带的 `node_modules` "
"不会被使用。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:35
msgid "Configuration-only customization"
msgstr "只改配置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:37
msgid ""
"Keep container wiring and assets in the deployment's own repository, and "
"edit application settings in Admin; the configuration backup includes "
"them. The JSON examples in `config/examples/` are input to copy or "
"import, never runtime defaults."
msgstr ""
"把容器编排和静态资源放在部署自己的仓库中，在 Admin 中编辑应用设置；配置备份会包含这些设置。`config/examples/` 中的 "
"JSON 示例是供复制或导入的输入，绝不是运行时默认值。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:42
msgid "The distribution manifest"
msgstr "发行版 manifest"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:44
msgid ""
"The distribution manifest is the `SITE_CONFIGURATION` setting: a JSON "
"document with the deployment's identity, public site and feature policy."
msgstr "发行版 manifest 就是 `SITE_CONFIGURATION` 设置项：一份 JSON 文档，包含部署的身份、公开站点和功能策略。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:57
msgid ""
"`features.public_signup: false` closes sign-up in both the API and the "
"console, whatever the ordinary sign-up switch says."
msgstr "`features.public_signup: false` 会同时在 API 和控制台中关闭注册，无论普通的注册开关如何设置。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:59
msgid "`features.rag: false` turns off the RAG endpoints."
msgstr "`features.rag: false` 会关闭 RAG 端点。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:60
msgid ""
"`features.openinfra: true` publishes, at `/openinfra`, the GPU fleet and "
"engine metrics that OpenInfra reporters collect. Collecting is the "
"separate `OPENINFRA_INGEST_TOKEN` setting; see [OpenInfra](openinfra.md)."
msgstr ""
"`features.openinfra: true` 会在 `/openinfra` 公开 OpenInfra 上报程序收集的 GPU "
"集群和推理引擎指标。数据收集由另一个设置项 `OPENINFRA_INGEST_TOKEN` 控制；见 "
"[OpenInfra](openinfra.md)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:63
msgid ""
"`features.public_stats: true` publishes usage statistics. Schedule "
"`python -m serving.analytics.public_stats` with the backend's "
"environment, `DB_*` and `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` included (for example "
"through `docker compose exec backend`); without a stored model catalog, "
"its snapshot has no per-model section."
msgstr ""
"`features.public_stats: true` 会公开用量统计。请用后端的环境（包括 `DB_*` 和 "
"`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS`）定时运行 `python -m serving.analytics.public_stats`（例如通过"
" `docker compose exec backend`）；没有已保存的模型目录时，它生成的快照不含按模型统计的部分。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:68
msgid ""
"`accounting.currency` defaults to `USD`. Switching to `CNY` needs an "
"offline ledger migration first, and once the gateway runs on a ledger "
"Admin refuses the change; see [Accounting Currency](accounting.md)."
msgstr ""
"`accounting.currency` 默认为 `USD`。改为 `CNY` 之前需要先做一次离线账本迁移；网关一旦在账本上运行，Admin "
"就会拒绝这项修改；见[记账货币](accounting.md)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:72
msgid "The document accepts no file paths. Use the `MODEL_CATALOG` setting (**Admin → Routing → Models**) and the `ROUTING_POLICY`, `ALERT_RULES` and `SITE_BRANDING` settings (under **Advanced settings** on the **Routing**, **Alerts** and **General** tabs of **Admin → Settings**) instead. Router selection belongs to each model in the catalog."
msgstr "该文档不接受文件路径。请改用 `MODEL_CATALOG` 设置项（**Admin → Routing → Models**），以及 `ROUTING_POLICY`、`ALERT_RULES` 和 `SITE_BRANDING` 设置项（位于 **Admin → Settings** 中 **Routing**、**Alerts** 和 **General** 标签页的 **Advanced settings** 下）。router 的选择属于目录中的每个模型。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:78
msgid "Activating a manifest"
msgstr "启用 manifest"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:80
msgid ""
"Save the document in Admin Settings. It applies when backend settings "
"refresh, normally within ten seconds. To bring in an old YAML manifest, "
"run the [legacy importer](configuration.md#model-and-routing-documents-"
"in-the-database) and check the stored documents before removing the old "
"files."
msgstr ""
"在 Admin Settings 中保存该文档。后端刷新设置时它就会生效，通常在十秒以内。要导入旧的 YAML "
"manifest，请运行[旧版导入工具](configuration.md#model-and-routing-documents-in-the-"
"database)，并在删除旧文件之前检查已保存的文档。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:85
msgid ""
"If the stored document stops validating, the gateway passes over it: the "
"explicit `SITE_*` settings and then neutral defaults apply, public sign-"
"up is closed, the RAG endpoints answer `503`, and the console reports the"
" configuration as incomplete until an administrator corrects the "
"document."
msgstr ""
"如果已保存的文档不再通过校验，网关会跳过它：先采用显式的 `SITE_*` 设置项，再采用中性默认值；公开注册关闭，RAG 端点返回 "
"`503`，控制台报告配置不完整，直到管理员修正该文档。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:90
msgid "Identity, and what the manifest must not contain"
msgstr "站点信息，以及 manifest 里不能放什么"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:92
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The site configuration and branding documents are public. Keep "
"credentials out of them; the site configuration refuses any credential, "
"even a `${NAME}` reference. Explicit `SITE_*` settings, such as "
"`SITE_NAME` and `SITE_SUPPORT_EMAIL`, win over the documents. A "
"deployment that sets neither is neutral."
msgstr ""
"站点配置和品牌文档都是公开的。不要在其中放入凭据；站点配置会拒绝任何凭据，即使是 `${NAME}` 引用。显式的 `SITE_*` 设置项（例如"
" `SITE_NAME` 和 `SITE_SUPPORT_EMAIL`）优先于这两份文档。两者都没有设置的部署是中性的。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:98
msgid "Runtime branding"
msgstr "运行时品牌配置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:100
msgid ""
"Set the `SITE_BRANDING` document in Admin Settings; "
"`config/examples/branding.example.json` shows its shape. The console "
"reads it from `/site-config`, so a change needs no new image. Public "
"images can be mounted read-only through `SITE_ASSETS_DIR`."
msgstr ""
"在 Admin Settings 中设置 `SITE_BRANDING` 文档；其结构见 "
"`config/examples/branding.example.json`。控制台从 `/site-config` "
"读取它，因此修改后无需新镜像。公开图片可以通过 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` 以只读方式挂载。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:105
msgid "The example distribution"
msgstr "示例发行版"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:107
msgid ""
"`make up DISTRIBUTION=example` selects the local tutorial overlay and "
"seeds its JSON settings. `make demo DISTRIBUTION=example` adds PostgreSQL"
" and the console; from then on, the stored settings win. The "
"`EXAMPLE_OVERLAY` marker keeps the example out of automatic distribution "
"discovery, so you always select it by name."
msgstr ""
"`make up DISTRIBUTION=example` 选择本地教程用的 overlay，并写入它的 JSON 设置。`make demo "
"DISTRIBUTION=example` 再加上 PostgreSQL 和控制台；此后以已保存的设置为准。`EXAMPLE_OVERLAY` "
"标记让示例不参与发行版的自动发现，因此总要按名称显式选择它。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:113
msgid "Upgrade checklist"
msgstr "升级检查清单"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:115
msgid ""
"This repository maintains the application and the interfaces it "
"publishes: configuration, Site UI modules and backend extensions. Each "
"distribution maintains its own configuration, module, deployment and any "
"fork, and decides when to upgrade."
msgstr ""
"本仓库维护应用本身，以及它对外发布的接口：配置、Site UI 模块和后端扩展。每个发行版自己维护自己的配置、模块、部署以及可能有的 "
"fork，并自己决定什么时候升级。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:120
msgid "An existing source fork"
msgstr "已有的源码 fork"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:122
msgid ""
"Inventory local changes by route and behavior. Separate branding values, "
"public-page presentation, shared-console changes and backend logic."
msgstr "按路由和行为盘点本地修改，区分品牌值、公开页面展示、共享控制台修改和后端逻辑。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:124
msgid ""
"Where they fit, move values into configuration and public-page "
"presentation into a Site UI module. This is optional; you can keep the "
"fork, with its ongoing merge and verification work."
msgstr ""
"在合适的地方，把各项取值移到配置中，把公开页面的呈现移到 Site UI 模块中。这一步可选；你也可以保留 "
"fork，并承担随之而来的持续合并和验证工作。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:127
msgid ""
"List the source changes that remain. Console redesigns, extra routes and "
"new authentication behavior do not become supported module features "
"because you move their files into the module directory."
msgstr "列出剩下的源码改动。把控制台重新设计、新增路由和新的认证行为的文件挪进模块目录，并不会让它们成为受支持的模块功能。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:130
msgid ""
"Merge the upstream version in a separate branch, resolve conflicts "
"against your required behavior, and build the exact frontend and backend "
"pair."
msgstr "在单独的分支中合并上游版本，按你需要的行为解决冲突，并构建确定的前后端镜像组合。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:132
msgid ""
"Verify the distribution in staging before promoting it. A clean merge or "
"a green upstream CI does not verify a fork's pages or flows."
msgstr "在推广上线之前，先在预发布环境验证发行版。干净的合并或上游 CI 通过，都不能证明 fork 的页面和流程没有问题。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:135
msgid "Before promotion"
msgstr "上线前"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:137
msgid ""
"Pin the upstream version and, for a custom UI, the module version and the"
" image digest. Keep the matching configuration and asset versions "
"recoverable."
msgstr "钉住上游版本；对于自定义 UI，还要钉住模块版本和镜像 digest。保证对应的配置和静态资源版本可以恢复。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:140
msgid "Read the configuration and API migration notes for the target version."
msgstr "阅读目标版本的配置和 API 迁移说明。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:141
msgid ""
"Check the image's `/app/site-ui-manifest.json` to confirm the standard or"
" custom build, and test packaged and mounted assets over HTTP."
msgstr "检查镜像中的 `/app/site-ui-manifest.json`，确认是标准构建还是自定义构建，并通过 HTTP 测试打包的和挂载的静态资源。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:143
msgid ""
"Check the public routes, configured links, narrow and wide layouts, "
"keyboard access, form validation, loading and errors, sign-in and sign-"
"out, and the registration policy."
msgstr "检查公开路由、已配置的链接、窄屏和宽屏布局、键盘操作、表单校验、加载和错误状态、登录和退出，以及注册策略。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:146
msgid ""
"Check the signed-in console, user and admin permissions, and an inference"
" request against the deployed candidate, including any fork behavior."
msgstr "针对已部署的候选版本，检查登录后的控制台、普通用户和管理员的权限，以及一个推理请求，包括 fork 特有的行为。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:148
msgid ""
"Promote only the tested image and configuration together, and keep the "
"previous pair for rollback."
msgstr "只把一起测试过的镜像和配置一同推广上线，并保留之前的组合以便回滚。"

